   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of independent media in Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall purpose is to further democracy , good governance and respect for human rights in Sri Lanka through furthering independant and credible media. The project strengthens MRTC and SLPI as leading media institutions in Sri Lanka.</narrative>
